WEBVTT

00:21.550 --> 00:22.120
Is it out?

00:23.620 --> 00:24.340
[IELTS Exam]

00:23.920 --> 00:24.420
What score?

00:24.370 --> 00:25.570
[Total score 6]

00:25.760 --> 00:26.830
Bowen, I got a six.

00:30.160 --> 00:30.710
A six?

00:32.880 --> 00:34.390
Are you sure you didn't miss a zero?

00:34.390 --> 00:35.390
No, it's six.

00:36.000 --> 00:37.000
Even if I just guessed,

00:37.000 --> 00:38.200
I could get over 10 points.

00:38.200 --> 00:39.860
How could you only score a six?

00:41.120 --> 00:41.840
You've disgraced Mom's status

00:41.840 --> 00:43.200
as an English teacher.

00:43.280 --> 00:43.680
Bowen—

00:43.750 --> 00:44.880
Come over here.

00:49.110 --> 00:49.550
Dad,

00:50.150 --> 00:50.520
Mom,

00:51.390 --> 00:52.390
I have failed you.

00:53.200 --> 00:53.960
I failed to fulfill

00:53.960 --> 00:55.290
the mission you gave me.

00:56.330 --> 00:57.220
I let you down.

00:57.520 --> 00:57.920
Bowen—

00:57.960 --> 00:58.470
Shut up!

00:59.150 --> 00:59.710
Have you forgotten

00:59.710 --> 01:00.520
why Mom

01:00.520 --> 01:01.390
named us Lang Bowen

01:01.390 --> 01:02.190
and Lang Botu?

01:02.430 --> 01:03.470
I haven't forgotten.

01:03.470 --> 01:03.960
Say it.

01:05.200 --> 01:05.940
Number one,

01:06.040 --> 01:06.700
number two.

01:06.760 --> 01:07.400
Louder!

01:08.760 --> 01:09.420
Number one!

01:09.590 --> 01:10.360
Number two!

01:11.120 --> 01:12.000
Mom had such high

01:12.000 --> 01:13.600
expectations for us.

01:15.150 --> 01:15.840
Number one,

01:16.120 --> 01:16.789
number two.

01:17.920 --> 01:19.070
If we had a sister...

01:19.150 --> 01:20.789
She would be named Number Three.

01:20.789 --> 01:21.190
Right.

01:21.480 --> 01:23.610
Translated, that would be Lang Bocui.

01:25.200 --> 01:27.230
I'm a failure, not cut out for school,

01:27.230 --> 01:28.840
and unworthy of the title "number one."

01:28.840 --> 01:30.300
Did your genes mutate too?

01:31.640 --> 01:32.200
A six.

01:33.400 --> 01:34.759
Aren't you ashamed?

01:36.000 --> 01:37.150
You're still laughing?

01:37.150 --> 01:38.150
Get on your knees!

01:39.920 --> 01:40.350
Kneel.

01:45.350 --> 01:45.789
Mom,

01:46.870 --> 01:48.120
I have good news.

01:48.759 --> 01:50.160
I scored a six on my IELTS.

01:50.680 --> 01:52.310
I can go abroad for grad school.

01:52.310 --> 01:53.440
Who are you kidding?

01:56.350 --> 01:56.759
Mom,

01:57.680 --> 01:59.080
I didn't mean it that way.

01:59.710 --> 02:00.910
He just made me so mad.

02:02.560 --> 02:04.090
I'm telling you, Lang Botu.

02:04.310 --> 02:05.170
You can fool me,

02:05.870 --> 02:06.840
but if you lie to Mom,

02:06.840 --> 02:08.240
believe it or not, I'll kick you to death.

02:08.240 --> 02:08.630
Bowen,

02:08.630 --> 02:10.520
how would I dare lie to Mom?

02:10.800 --> 02:12.000
I really passed.

02:12.670 --> 02:13.840
For the IELTS,

02:13.840 --> 02:14.840
a perfect score is nine.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.560
With a six,

02:15.560 --> 02:17.290
I can go abroad for grad school.

02:19.430 --> 02:20.690
You aren't fooling me?

02:20.840 --> 02:22.280
I'm really not.

02:24.680 --> 02:25.940
You scared me to death.

02:26.560 --> 02:27.870
Can you be gentler?

02:27.870 --> 02:29.750
Who designed this scoring system?

02:29.750 --> 02:30.800
So messed up.

02:33.079 --> 02:34.240
Mom, Dad,

02:34.840 --> 02:35.400
Yangyang

02:36.360 --> 02:38.150
can apply to foreign universities now.

02:38.150 --> 02:39.410
Your spirits in heaven

02:39.520 --> 02:40.520
can rest in peace.

04:01.890 --> 04:05.640
[Born with Luck]

04:05.730 --> 04:08.720
[Episode 11]

04:26.680 --> 04:27.480
You should go.

04:27.750 --> 04:28.810
He'll be back soon.

04:30.040 --> 04:30.570
Then I...

04:32.560 --> 04:33.890
I'm leaving then, Ying.

05:58.600 --> 05:59.070
Hey,

05:59.510 --> 06:00.440
why are you here?

06:01.870 --> 06:02.730
I just got here.

06:02.920 --> 06:03.780
Looking for me?

06:04.870 --> 06:05.800
Need something?

06:06.480 --> 06:07.080
Of course.

06:07.430 --> 06:08.510
I want to get a drink with you.

06:08.510 --> 06:09.240
If you wanted to drink,

06:09.240 --> 06:10.700
you could've just called.

06:11.120 --> 06:12.920
Why did you come all the way here?

06:14.630 --> 06:16.310
I just wanted to come in person,

06:16.310 --> 06:17.240
so I didn't call.

06:19.070 --> 06:20.600
Look at how guilty you're acting.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.310
Are you hiding

06:21.310 --> 06:22.370
something from me?

06:27.560 --> 06:28.190
Me?

06:30.240 --> 06:31.500
I just had to come over.

06:32.240 --> 06:32.950
Why?

06:36.830 --> 06:37.720
We are bros.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.780
Can't you just give it to me straight?

06:44.870 --> 06:45.360
Kai,

06:50.159 --> 06:50.820
I want to...

06:54.390 --> 06:55.650
I'm giving this to you.

06:58.240 --> 06:59.100
What happened?

07:00.360 --> 07:01.690
I loaned out some money.

07:03.240 --> 07:05.240
I'm collecting the debt these days.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.460
The guy is a tough nut to crack.

07:09.190 --> 07:10.990
If I come back in a couple of days,

07:11.310 --> 07:12.710
you can give it back to me.

07:13.720 --> 07:14.920
If I don't come back,

07:17.000 --> 07:17.930
the car is yours.

07:22.950 --> 07:23.680
Who are they?

07:23.950 --> 07:24.880
I'll go with you.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.080
It's too dangerous.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.560
I'll do it myself.

07:41.870 --> 07:42.390
Bro...

07:42.750 --> 07:43.950
It's very dangerous!

07:54.480 --> 07:55.280
He's so loyal.

07:56.800 --> 07:58.000
I've always wanted to drive it.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.600
Let's take it for a spin. Go!

08:19.240 --> 08:20.900
There is a theory in economics

08:21.800 --> 08:23.270
that a person will encounter at least

08:23.270 --> 08:25.190
three major opportunities in life.

08:25.190 --> 08:26.480
If you grasp just one,

08:27.120 --> 08:30.180
you can turn your life around
and cross social classes.

08:30.680 --> 08:31.800
Most people spend their whole lives

08:31.800 --> 08:33.150
without grasping even one.

08:33.150 --> 08:33.720
Why?

08:35.510 --> 08:37.240
Because they are not prepared.

08:38.030 --> 08:40.240
They don't realize
when an opportunity comes.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.270
Looking back, they realize

08:41.270 --> 08:43.320
that it slipped through their fingers.

08:43.320 --> 08:44.630
Opportunities are always left for

08:44.630 --> 08:45.960
those who are prepared.

08:46.960 --> 08:48.760
Looking back at my past decades,

08:49.360 --> 08:51.960
I've already missed
my first big opportunity.

08:52.790 --> 08:54.550
I didn't do well
in the college entrance exam,

08:54.550 --> 08:57.150
so I planned to study abroad
to improve my resume.

08:57.150 --> 08:58.960
My family sold our house back then

08:58.960 --> 09:02.420
and scraped together hundreds of thousands
to send me abroad.

09:02.840 --> 09:04.670
If we had kept that house until now,

09:04.670 --> 09:06.600
we would've received
demolition compensation

09:06.600 --> 09:08.260
and be worth over ten million.

09:08.270 --> 09:09.930
I wouldn't need to do this job.

09:10.960 --> 09:12.960
But there's no point in regretting.

09:13.320 --> 09:15.030
People have to look forward.

09:15.670 --> 09:16.960
Now, the second big opportunity

09:16.960 --> 09:18.200
of this lifetime,

09:18.960 --> 09:21.160
Zhou Rong, this big fish, has swum over.

09:22.480 --> 09:24.360
We must be fully prepared.

09:25.240 --> 09:26.750
We absolutely cannot let this one

09:26.750 --> 09:28.240
slip through our fingers again.

09:28.240 --> 09:28.720
Chao,

09:29.240 --> 09:31.440
it's not about slipping through
our fingers now.

09:31.440 --> 09:32.970
If he really comes head-on,

09:33.150 --> 09:34.390
we could stop him.

09:34.870 --> 09:36.320
The problem now

09:36.790 --> 09:38.270
is that he's ahead of us,

09:38.270 --> 09:39.670
and we can't catch up.

09:40.320 --> 09:41.270
What's the rush?

09:41.510 --> 09:42.720
There's always a way.

09:46.600 --> 09:48.270
We need to get a good car.

10:06.000 --> 10:06.870
So annoying.

10:12.960 --> 10:13.910
No manners.

10:15.080 --> 10:16.070
What the hell?

10:40.670 --> 10:41.630
Do you know how to drive?

10:41.630 --> 10:42.600
Are you blind?

10:45.360 --> 10:46.600
Bastards.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.560
Get out of the car if you dare.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.750
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

11:07.240 --> 11:07.670
Chao,

11:08.270 --> 11:09.670
this jerk is relentless.

11:08.430 --> 11:09.270
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

11:09.840 --> 11:10.840
I told you not to cause trouble.

11:10.840 --> 11:12.100
We have a gun in the car.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.000
If we cause a scene

11:12.710 --> 11:13.690
♪ Ha ha ha ha ♪

11:13.000 --> 11:13.720
and attract the cops,

11:13.720 --> 11:15.180
we'll go straight to jail.

11:18.040 --> 11:22.250
♪ The sacred light is reborn ♪

11:23.370 --> 11:26.900
♪ The dream of every machine ♪

11:24.360 --> 11:24.790
Stop the car!

11:24.790 --> 11:26.360
Brake!

11:27.720 --> 11:31.550
♪ Foolishness spreads in the revelry ♪

11:32.550 --> 11:33.960
♪ This is humanity ♪

11:34.450 --> 11:36.090
♪ This is humanity ♪

11:52.000 --> 11:52.480
Chao,

11:53.510 --> 11:54.840
it's totally our fault.

11:55.120 --> 11:56.980
You sure know traffic rules well.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.000
You two jerks,

11:59.000 --> 12:00.000
get out of the car!

12:02.360 --> 12:03.160
Are you crazy?

12:04.720 --> 12:05.720
You stay in the car.

12:05.720 --> 12:06.440
Don't get out.

12:06.440 --> 12:07.030
Be good.

12:07.270 --> 12:08.390
Get the hell out!

12:16.480 --> 12:17.480
Sir, are you okay?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.270
Here, Mr. Green Hat,

12:19.270 --> 12:20.000
have a smoke and calm down.

12:20.000 --> 12:20.870
Okay my ass!

12:21.000 --> 12:22.630
Look at how you smashed my car.

12:22.630 --> 12:23.840
Cut the crap. Pay up.

12:24.510 --> 12:25.080
Pay up?

12:25.960 --> 12:26.720
Sir, look,

12:26.720 --> 12:28.520
you've been brake-checking us all the way.

12:28.520 --> 12:29.000
Damn,

12:29.030 --> 12:30.690
you have the nerve to say that?

12:30.790 --> 12:32.480
I honked all the way for you to stop.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.360
Are you deaf?

12:33.550 --> 12:34.080
Besides,

12:34.080 --> 12:34.910
if that jerk in your car

12:34.910 --> 12:36.200
hadn't spit at me,

12:36.320 --> 12:37.120
why would I cut you off?

12:37.120 --> 12:38.510
Sir, let's keep things separate.

12:38.510 --> 12:40.200
The rear-end is your fault
for cutting me off,

12:40.200 --> 12:42.240
and the spitting is my buddy's fault.

12:42.240 --> 12:43.270
The end result is that both cars

12:43.270 --> 12:44.030
are damaged.

12:44.480 --> 12:46.080
I suggest we each fix our own.

12:47.240 --> 12:47.970
Cut the crap.

12:48.150 --> 12:48.630
Pay up.

12:49.960 --> 12:50.480
Go back.

12:59.600 --> 13:01.260
It's just about money, right?

13:01.510 --> 13:02.120
I only have

13:02.200 --> 13:03.480
3,000 here. Take it all.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.490
I have some small change too.

13:04.490 --> 13:04.870
No.

13:04.910 --> 13:06.030
I'll give it all to you, okay?

13:06.030 --> 13:06.440
No,

13:06.750 --> 13:08.440
you smashed my car like this,

13:08.630 --> 13:10.030
and you're offering 3,000?

13:10.030 --> 13:11.240
To fully repair this car,

13:11.240 --> 13:12.770
it'll cost at least 30,000!

13:14.720 --> 13:16.520
Sir, look at the car I'm driving.

13:16.550 --> 13:18.080
Do I look like I have 30,000?

13:22.630 --> 13:23.030
Fine.

13:23.240 --> 13:23.630
Fine.

13:23.870 --> 13:24.730
I admit defeat.

13:25.030 --> 13:26.240
I'm not trying to extort you.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.960
Extorting you with this piece of junk
is pointless anyway.

13:27.960 --> 13:28.600
How about this?

13:28.600 --> 13:30.460
You call your insurance company,

13:30.480 --> 13:32.540
so you won't have to
pay out of pocket.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.710
To be honest with you,

13:37.200 --> 13:39.000
our car doesn't have insurance.

13:39.080 --> 13:40.270
Either you take the 3,000,

13:40.270 --> 13:41.360
or you take full responsibility

13:41.360 --> 13:43.220
and go to your insurance company.

13:44.790 --> 13:46.390
I take full responsibility?

13:47.910 --> 13:49.080
You hit my car

13:49.080 --> 13:51.030
and want me to take full responsibility?

13:51.030 --> 13:52.230
Is that what you mean?

13:54.960 --> 13:55.840
Then how about I just give you my car?

13:55.840 --> 13:56.640
Do you want it?

14:09.320 --> 14:09.790
Yes.

14:12.120 --> 14:15.680
[We are college students
who lost our money. Please help.]

14:15.710 --> 14:18.940
[Bless you kind people.]

14:19.360 --> 14:21.620
The market was better back in those days.

14:21.720 --> 14:23.030
Setting up an endgame on the overpass

14:23.030 --> 14:24.630
could earn me hundreds a day.

14:24.910 --> 14:25.970
What's an endgame?

14:26.840 --> 14:27.570
Have a heart.

14:28.870 --> 14:29.550
Chess.

14:31.150 --> 14:33.410
You don't understand that stuff anyway.

14:33.910 --> 14:35.780
We don't look like college students,
do we?

14:35.780 --> 14:36.710
What do you know?

14:36.920 --> 14:38.250
[We are college students
who lost our money. Please help.]

14:37.270 --> 14:38.130
Have some pity.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.430
[Bless you kind people.]

14:39.390 --> 14:40.630
That Professor Fu

14:40.630 --> 14:41.720
from Jingda University's math department

14:41.720 --> 14:42.580
is just like us.

14:43.390 --> 14:44.190
That unlucky?

14:46.360 --> 14:47.090
Ridiculous.

14:49.080 --> 14:50.270
Is there any food at home?

14:50.270 --> 14:52.000
There are some digestion pills.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.130
Don't mention that.

14:56.270 --> 14:57.120
Have a heart.

14:57.150 --> 14:58.240
Give us eight bucks.

14:58.240 --> 14:58.670
Is there

14:58.670 --> 14:59.600
a junkyard nearby?

14:59.600 --> 15:00.150
Give us eight bucks

15:00.150 --> 15:01.550
and we'll take you there.

15:01.910 --> 15:02.510
Then we...

15:05.360 --> 15:06.320
Where you think you going?

15:06.320 --> 15:07.150
Where you think you going?

15:07.150 --> 15:07.600
What?

15:07.630 --> 15:09.000
Honghong, Maomao or whatever.

15:09.000 --> 15:10.090
Hong... Hongwei.

15:10.240 --> 15:10.790
Hongwei.

15:10.870 --> 15:11.930
What are you doing?

15:12.360 --> 15:12.840
What?

15:13.270 --> 15:13.930
Who are you?

15:15.080 --> 15:16.870
He owes me money. I'm collecting debt.

15:16.870 --> 15:17.080
Hey,

15:17.080 --> 15:18.120
if he owes money, talk about the money.

15:18.120 --> 15:19.600
Why are you getting physical?

15:19.600 --> 15:20.150
So what?

15:20.670 --> 15:22.000
How much does he owe you?

15:22.030 --> 15:23.160
A hundred thousand.

15:24.630 --> 15:25.550
A hundred thousand?

15:25.550 --> 15:25.840
Wait.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.630
You're asking people like us

15:26.630 --> 15:27.360
for 100,000?

15:27.790 --> 15:29.450
Are you broke out of your mind?

15:30.510 --> 15:31.240
What is this?

15:31.310 --> 15:32.610
[IOU]

15:37.270 --> 15:38.130
You wrote this?

15:39.310 --> 15:40.040
I wrote this.

15:42.780 --> 15:45.120
-Don't have that much money.
-Don't have that much money.

15:45.120 --> 15:45.880
No money?

15:46.320 --> 15:47.320
Don't you have a junkyard?

15:47.320 --> 15:48.200
Use that to pay the debt.

15:48.200 --> 15:48.480
No,

15:48.510 --> 15:49.440
that junkyard

15:49.440 --> 15:50.390
-It's his.
-It’s mine.

15:50.390 --> 15:50.910
Right.

15:51.090 --> 15:51.490
Well,

15:51.720 --> 15:52.720
how can you use my junkyard

15:52.720 --> 15:53.580
to pay his debt?

15:53.600 --> 15:54.240
Why not?

15:54.840 --> 15:56.000
That's not reasonable.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.430
Do I look like a reasonable person?

15:57.430 --> 15:59.090
He's not a reasonable person.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.100
Hey, you...

16:01.150 --> 16:02.190
How about this?

16:02.390 --> 16:03.600
You just strangle him,

16:03.600 --> 16:04.830
and won't the debt be written off?

16:04.830 --> 16:06.630
-Sir, don’t.
-Can you be reasonable?

16:06.630 --> 16:07.720
How am I not reasonable?

16:07.720 --> 16:08.390
If I strangle him,

16:08.390 --> 16:09.440
wouldn't you still have to pay the debt?

16:09.440 --> 16:10.120
Right, then wouldn't it still be...

16:10.120 --> 16:11.120
Why should I pay the debt?

16:11.120 --> 16:11.600
Why?

16:11.720 --> 16:12.480
Why?

16:14.790 --> 16:15.390
Why?

16:15.390 --> 16:16.520
No, there's a knife.

16:16.550 --> 16:17.080
No, no.

16:17.240 --> 16:17.840
No need.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.510
No need, sir.

16:18.510 --> 16:19.320
No, no need to show it.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.030
-No need to show it.
-Thank you.

16:20.030 --> 16:20.550
I appreciate the thought.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.950
Thanks for your trouble.

16:22.910 --> 16:23.440
Well...

16:24.600 --> 16:25.030
So...

16:26.390 --> 16:27.590
There's an IOU.

16:27.960 --> 16:29.690
The money was borrowed, right?

16:32.150 --> 16:33.410
A hundred thousand...

16:33.750 --> 16:35.200
Give me a week.

16:35.910 --> 16:37.840
I'll pay you back 100,000 in a week.

16:38.790 --> 16:39.590
Is a week okay?

16:39.910 --> 16:40.320
Okay.

16:41.120 --> 16:41.720
One week.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.550
Is there any place nearby
that sells zipper oil?

16:47.550 --> 16:48.750
Over there, up there.

16:48.910 --> 16:49.510
Turn left.

16:50.320 --> 16:50.840
Why?

16:56.960 --> 16:58.390
You talked too fast.

16:59.390 --> 17:00.510
You promised him a week.

17:00.510 --> 17:01.000
Can you get 100,000

17:01.000 --> 17:02.080
in a week?

17:02.480 --> 17:03.720
Anyway, I don't have it.

17:03.720 --> 17:04.200
What?

17:04.349 --> 17:06.310
Do you think money grows on trees?

17:06.790 --> 17:07.589
No, Tinggang!

17:07.680 --> 17:08.790
Don't!

17:08.790 --> 17:10.390
How dare you borrow 100,000?

17:10.440 --> 17:11.040
Tinggang.

17:11.310 --> 17:12.240
It's Li Penggai.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.710
Li Penggai extorted me.

17:14.069 --> 17:14.750
Li Penggai?

17:14.790 --> 17:15.310
Yes.

17:15.510 --> 17:16.230
Li Penggai said

17:16.230 --> 17:17.349
as long as he got the 100,000,

17:17.349 --> 17:19.079
he wouldn't give us a hard time.

17:20.730 --> 17:22.440
He wouldn't give you a hard time!

17:22.440 --> 17:24.099
What does it have to do with me?

17:24.109 --> 17:24.880
I...

17:24.930 --> 17:26.200
I just brought you in.

17:26.200 --> 17:27.530
You just joined, right?

17:28.030 --> 17:28.440
You...

17:28.960 --> 17:29.360
You...

17:29.510 --> 17:30.310
Don't, don't.

17:31.000 --> 17:31.400
I...

17:35.350 --> 17:37.210
Where are we going to get 100,000?

17:40.270 --> 17:42.110
If we can't, let's pull off a big heist!

17:42.110 --> 17:42.830
How big?

17:45.070 --> 17:47.400
If we can't, let's pull off
a medium heist!

17:48.270 --> 17:49.240
Medium is fine.

18:12.510 --> 18:13.370
How about here?

18:13.960 --> 18:14.820
Is anyone here?

18:16.880 --> 18:17.750
Is anyone here?

18:19.110 --> 18:20.310
Is anyone here?

18:25.200 --> 18:26.720
Since we got to Sanjiangkou,

18:26.720 --> 18:27.750
this car has been with us.

18:27.750 --> 18:28.720
Now that we're selling it,

18:28.720 --> 18:30.120
I kind of miss it already.

18:30.640 --> 18:32.640
You got infected by that corrupt official.

18:32.640 --> 18:33.830
You're addicted to junk cars.

18:33.830 --> 18:34.880
Not exactly.

18:35.590 --> 18:36.920
We bought it for 25,000.

18:37.110 --> 18:39.310
Is it appropriate to sell it for 30,000?

18:41.720 --> 18:43.000
I'm thinking too small.

18:43.000 --> 18:44.400
We'll sell it for 50,000.

18:46.270 --> 18:47.130
Is anyone here?

18:47.790 --> 18:48.850
Is anyone here?

18:48.920 --> 18:50.250
Alright, stop yelling.

18:51.070 --> 18:51.510
You know

18:51.510 --> 18:53.400
we bought this junk car for 25,000.

18:53.400 --> 18:55.330
But 20,000 went to fake documents.

18:55.720 --> 18:57.310
The car is only worth 5,000.

18:58.920 --> 19:01.520
So you mean we'll sell it
at the original price?

19:12.960 --> 19:13.270
No.

19:13.440 --> 19:15.300
We can't sell it by weight, right?

19:16.790 --> 19:18.400
You just mentioned thinking small.

19:18.400 --> 19:19.400
I reflected on it.

19:19.920 --> 19:21.880
We are going to pull off a big heist now.

19:21.880 --> 19:23.200
Can we haggle over

19:23.200 --> 19:24.310
this petty cash?

19:25.000 --> 19:26.400
What if this car

19:26.440 --> 19:27.840
exposes our whereabouts

19:28.160 --> 19:29.420
and alerts the police?

19:29.880 --> 19:31.610
How can we do great things then?

19:32.430 --> 19:33.430
Then what do we do?

19:35.110 --> 19:36.510
We'll give the car away.

19:36.720 --> 19:37.450
Give it away?

19:37.750 --> 19:38.400
To whom?

19:38.590 --> 19:39.720
There's no one here.

19:40.070 --> 19:41.640
Because there is no one here,

19:41.640 --> 19:42.960
no one will see us.

19:44.750 --> 19:46.150
We'll just leave it here.

19:59.830 --> 20:01.430
First time doing a good deed.

20:01.510 --> 20:03.440
I'll leave a note for the lucky one.

20:14.550 --> 20:15.350
Stop shaking!

20:15.790 --> 20:16.440
If you break

20:16.440 --> 20:17.160
my new car's suspension,

20:17.160 --> 20:18.070
I'll kill you.

20:22.030 --> 20:23.090
Can you rob houses?

20:25.920 --> 20:27.720
Can you murder and commit arson?

20:29.310 --> 20:30.350
Can you commit petty theft?

20:30.350 --> 20:31.080
I can do that.

20:31.590 --> 20:32.430
No, you can't!

20:32.430 --> 20:34.270
You don't even dare to steal a bicycle.

20:34.270 --> 20:35.200
For that 100,000,

20:35.200 --> 20:36.800
we have to steal a car, got it?

20:38.510 --> 20:38.920
Bro.

20:39.000 --> 20:39.880
Don't call me bro.

20:39.880 --> 20:41.080
There really is a car.

20:43.110 --> 20:45.170
Even if there is a car, it's not yours.

20:45.480 --> 20:46.480
Whose car is this?

20:47.270 --> 20:48.310
Who parked their car here?

20:48.310 --> 20:49.440
You can't park here!

20:50.350 --> 20:51.310
Who parked here?

20:51.880 --> 20:52.590
For...

20:53.720 --> 20:54.110
free.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.160
F-for free?

20:55.510 --> 20:56.240
For free?

20:56.400 --> 20:56.880
In your dreams.

20:56.880 --> 20:57.640
No, look.

20:58.480 --> 20:59.070
Impossible.

20:59.070 --> 20:59.510
Look.

20:59.950 --> 21:02.900
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

21:00.040 --> 21:03.890
[For free]

21:00.720 --> 21:01.270
Look.

21:01.480 --> 21:02.920
I recognize these two words.

21:02.920 --> 21:03.790
It's for free.

21:05.750 --> 21:06.750
Isn't it for free?

21:06.900 --> 21:11.520
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

21:08.400 --> 21:09.660
The car door opens too.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.310
Heaven blessed us?

21:22.920 --> 21:24.850
And it comes with half a tank of gas.

21:32.000 --> 21:33.260
Will this leave a scar?

21:33.830 --> 21:34.920
It's a very small cut.

21:34.920 --> 21:36.180
Don't worry, it won't.

21:38.160 --> 21:38.900
Song Xing,

21:39.000 --> 21:40.460
you are really something.

21:40.590 --> 21:42.790
You acted recklessly
and got Li Qian injured.

21:42.790 --> 21:43.880
If something really went wrong,

21:43.880 --> 21:45.480
could you take the responsibility?

21:45.480 --> 21:46.540
Stop scolding him.

21:49.680 --> 21:51.210
Chief Zhang, Captain Wang.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.400
There's nothing I can do either.

21:53.400 --> 21:54.750
We can't control this matter.

21:54.750 --> 21:55.640
If word gets out...

21:55.640 --> 21:56.700
Yes, I know, I know.

21:57.640 --> 21:58.570
Why are you here?

21:58.750 --> 22:00.640
You should rest for a couple of days.

22:00.640 --> 22:02.030
It's too stuffy in the dorm.

22:02.030 --> 22:02.920
Please let me work.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.550
No, you'd better not join for now.

22:04.550 --> 22:05.960
If I let you work while injured again,

22:05.960 --> 22:07.890
Director Gao will punish me again.

22:11.550 --> 22:12.480
I'll punish him.

22:14.600 --> 22:16.130
Li Qian, come here.

22:20.010 --> 22:20.720
Come.

22:21.310 --> 22:21.970
Stand here.

22:22.640 --> 22:23.440
Get over here.

22:28.400 --> 22:30.260
Do you know why the chief is angry?

22:31.880 --> 22:33.590
Because I publicly pointed out

22:33.590 --> 22:34.400
that he misread a word.

22:34.400 --> 22:35.240
Cut the crap.

22:36.070 --> 22:37.730
Would the chief be this petty?

22:41.480 --> 22:43.480
I'm telling you, listen carefully.

22:43.510 --> 22:44.520
It's because

22:44.920 --> 22:46.070
the girl got hurt.

22:47.590 --> 22:50.250
Song Xing, you're considered
a veteran, right?

22:50.440 --> 22:51.770
Li Qian is just a rookie.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.460
When things happen to you,

22:53.790 --> 22:55.590
you're impulsive and reckless.

22:55.680 --> 22:56.880
When things happen to Li Qian,

22:56.880 --> 22:58.240
she's calm and collected.

22:58.240 --> 22:59.590
You call yourself an investigator,

22:59.590 --> 23:00.750
yet you got locked in an elevator.

23:00.750 --> 23:01.480
If word gets out,

23:01.480 --> 23:02.510
you'll become a laughingstock.

23:02.510 --> 23:02.960
Right?

23:04.440 --> 23:05.100
Li Qian here

23:05.510 --> 23:07.240
outsmarted ruthless bandits.

23:07.550 --> 23:08.480
If word gets out,

23:08.680 --> 23:10.440
everyone will give her a thumbs up.

23:10.440 --> 23:11.770
Don't you feel ashamed?

23:15.720 --> 23:16.380
I was wrong.

23:16.680 --> 23:17.540
You were wrong.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.960
As for the future work of the task force,

23:19.960 --> 23:21.760
don't participate in it for now.

23:21.830 --> 23:22.890
Don't do this, I...

23:23.480 --> 23:24.240
C-Chief.

23:24.270 --> 23:24.590
I...

23:24.750 --> 23:25.830
I urgently need a chance now

23:25.830 --> 23:26.760
to prove myself.

23:27.000 --> 23:27.590
If Captain Wang doesn't let me

23:27.590 --> 23:28.640
participate in the investigation,

23:28.640 --> 23:29.160
then won't I really become

23:29.160 --> 23:30.420
the joke of the bureau?

23:30.750 --> 23:31.880
You already are the personification

23:31.880 --> 23:32.880
of a joke.

23:33.400 --> 23:33.800
You...

23:36.310 --> 23:37.720
Then what should I do?

23:38.200 --> 23:38.720
You...

23:38.880 --> 23:40.680
You can make up for your mistakes

23:41.030 --> 23:42.240
by taking care of the injured.

23:42.240 --> 23:43.840
When Li Qian's injury heals,

23:44.110 --> 23:45.770
we'll talk about your matter.

23:49.510 --> 23:50.110
Let's start the meeting.

23:50.110 --> 23:50.480
Okay.

23:52.400 --> 23:53.660
Come on, meeting time.

24:07.880 --> 24:08.540
Let me do it.

24:10.590 --> 24:13.120
Are you really
taking care of me exclusively?

24:14.160 --> 24:15.220
I'm sorry, Li Qian.

24:17.350 --> 24:19.160
These days, I'm so unlucky
cold water gets stuck in my teeth.

24:19.160 --> 24:21.020
Let's just wait for the hot water.

24:26.030 --> 24:27.830
That crappy elevator
at Zheng Yongbing's place...

24:27.830 --> 24:28.690
Did I blame you?

24:31.020 --> 24:31.470
No.

24:31.750 --> 24:32.830
I blame myself.

24:33.270 --> 24:34.790
Blaming yourself is useless now.

24:34.790 --> 24:35.750
We need to find a way

24:35.750 --> 24:37.350
to get back to the task force.

24:37.720 --> 24:39.480
That's why I'm here to take care of you.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.590
Your injury needs to heal quickly

24:40.590 --> 24:41.850
for us to have any hope.

24:45.030 --> 24:46.240
Did you really not find anything

24:46.240 --> 24:47.770
at Zheng Yongbing's place?

24:48.070 --> 24:49.000
I found nothing.

24:49.510 --> 24:51.170
There are photos of the scene.

25:08.200 --> 25:09.680
Then did you check Ye Jian's

25:09.680 --> 25:10.280
computer,

25:10.720 --> 25:11.310
phone,

25:11.440 --> 25:12.680
apps, WeChat,

25:13.160 --> 25:15.370
and other electronics?

25:15.550 --> 25:17.270
We've finished this part too.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.790
Before Captain Ye left,

25:18.000 --> 25:18.960
[Buy now] [Add to cart]

25:18.920 --> 25:20.440
the last thing he opened on his computer

25:20.440 --> 25:21.350
was Taobao.

25:23.080 --> 25:24.510
[Price 19.90 yuan]

25:23.640 --> 25:24.370
It's a watch.

25:25.240 --> 25:25.830
Chief,

25:26.310 --> 25:27.160
could this be

25:27.160 --> 25:28.090
a breakthrough?

25:31.510 --> 25:35.480
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

25:36.830 --> 25:37.830
Looks different.

25:41.590 --> 25:42.480
Purchase link?

25:46.460 --> 25:48.080
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

25:48.350 --> 25:50.080
Captain Ye browsed this watch?

25:53.590 --> 25:55.520
Why would Captain Ye check Liu Bei?

25:59.250 --> 26:02.390
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

26:08.600 --> 26:10.580
[Zheng Yongbing]

26:11.160 --> 26:12.560
This is our only clue now.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.090
[Liu Bei]

26:19.160 --> 26:23.720
[Zheng Yongbing] [Liu Bei]

26:19.240 --> 26:20.570
The most urgent task...

26:23.110 --> 26:23.910
is to find him.

26:25.270 --> 26:25.920
Chief Zhang,

26:25.920 --> 26:27.650
this discovery is very timely,

26:28.480 --> 26:29.930
but it doesn't seem to

26:30.240 --> 26:31.680
relate to Captain Ye

26:31.680 --> 26:32.740
and Chief Lu's case.

26:32.740 --> 26:36.500
[Zheng Yongbing] [Liu Bei]

26:50.730 --> 26:51.850
[Hu Jianren]

26:53.510 --> 26:54.160
Chief Zhang,

26:54.160 --> 26:56.030
any new discoveries?

27:00.030 --> 27:01.200
Let me organize my thoughts.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.000
Wait a moment.

27:07.630 --> 27:11.380
[Hu Jianren]

27:12.230 --> 27:13.330
[Complainant: car dealer,
sold a used car nearby]

27:13.350 --> 27:14.710
[Lu Zheng car crash]

27:14.730 --> 27:16.000
[Li Qian escorts Zhang Yi'ang home]

27:16.900 --> 27:19.060
[Hu Jianren]

27:19.090 --> 27:22.960
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

27:23.210 --> 27:23.980
[Chairman of Rongcheng Group: Zhou Rong]

27:24.000 --> 27:25.210
[Ping'an City jewelry shop robbery case]

27:25.230 --> 27:26.700
[Hu Jianren]

27:29.160 --> 27:29.590
Who?

27:29.750 --> 27:30.240
Get out.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.160
No, no, no.

27:31.380 --> 27:33.580
Stand up and speak if you have any ideas.

27:33.640 --> 27:34.240
Any ideas?

27:34.790 --> 27:35.480
Anything to say?

27:35.480 --> 27:36.070
Do you?

27:36.750 --> 27:37.110
No.

27:37.160 --> 27:37.850
If not,

27:38.000 --> 27:39.000
be quiet. Don't make a sound.

27:39.000 --> 27:39.550
Okay?

27:39.720 --> 27:41.650
No one is allowed to
interrupt Chief Zhang's thinking.

27:41.650 --> 27:42.480
Understand?

27:42.550 --> 27:43.030
Yes.

27:44.590 --> 27:45.320
Chief Zhang,

27:45.480 --> 27:46.340
keep thinking.

27:47.070 --> 27:47.670
It's okay.

28:07.880 --> 28:08.810
This watch...

28:08.920 --> 28:10.350
It was found in Zheng Yongbing's home.

28:10.350 --> 28:11.610
He said Liu Bei left it.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.840
Then is this watch the one...

28:16.000 --> 28:16.560
Chief.

28:16.590 --> 28:18.120
What are you two doing here?

28:21.400 --> 28:22.400
It seems we are late.

28:22.400 --> 28:24.260
Chief has already figured it out.

28:24.830 --> 28:25.790
That's impossible.

28:25.790 --> 28:27.390
We just found out about this.

28:27.400 --> 28:27.980
Chief,

28:28.170 --> 28:29.550
we found some clues.

28:29.750 --> 28:30.110
What?

28:33.480 --> 28:34.510
What? Tell me.

28:35.020 --> 28:37.750
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

28:35.750 --> 28:36.110
No.

28:36.350 --> 28:37.400
There's still a slight difference.

28:37.400 --> 28:39.260
They don't look exactly the same.

28:43.370 --> 28:48.050
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

28:50.920 --> 28:52.020
They're the same, right?

28:51.920 --> 28:53.410
[Vintage square student
male waterproof digital watch]

28:52.110 --> 28:53.240
This one is the same.

28:53.750 --> 28:55.350
Ye was looking at this watch.

28:55.750 --> 28:56.480
Chief Zhang,

28:57.110 --> 28:58.510
you're a true detective.

28:58.750 --> 29:00.200
Are you clairvoyant?

29:01.830 --> 29:03.360
This watch is so expensive.

29:03.830 --> 29:05.160
Should we investigate?

29:07.790 --> 29:08.520
Chief Zhang,

29:09.030 --> 29:10.510
checking the watch isn't dangerous.

29:10.510 --> 29:10.920
Give me a chance

29:10.920 --> 29:11.920
to redeem myself.

29:14.520 --> 29:17.490
[Fenglinwan Hotel]

29:29.240 --> 29:30.100
Why are we here?

29:31.110 --> 29:32.400
The only luxury watch store in Sanjiangkou

29:32.400 --> 29:33.330
is right inside.

29:33.400 --> 29:33.930
Let's go.

29:43.720 --> 29:44.310
I'm telling you,

29:44.310 --> 29:45.750
those new girls,

29:46.640 --> 29:47.200
don't...

29:53.400 --> 29:54.270
Those are cops.

29:54.880 --> 29:56.280
What are they doing here?

30:02.920 --> 30:03.400
What?

30:09.830 --> 30:12.090
Limited edition with a serial number...

30:13.160 --> 30:15.160
This is the only one in Sanjiangkou.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.030
I remember

30:17.400 --> 30:19.200
a customer brought it in before.

30:19.790 --> 30:20.390
Who was it?

30:22.310 --> 30:23.750
Do you want an appraisal

30:23.920 --> 30:24.920
or maintenance?

30:27.240 --> 30:28.700
Is this watch real or fake?

30:29.960 --> 30:31.160
That's an appraisal.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.480
Two hundred yuan.

30:33.200 --> 30:35.200
-We are...
-Let's do the appraisal.

30:41.830 --> 30:42.890
We're undercover.

30:49.070 --> 30:49.550
Mr. Lu!

30:52.270 --> 30:53.400
What a coincidence.

30:53.880 --> 30:54.830
Yes, yes.

30:56.880 --> 30:57.640
Since you have already

30:57.640 --> 30:58.720
followed us here,

30:58.920 --> 30:59.750
come on in.

31:06.160 --> 31:06.790
Mr. Lu.

31:07.750 --> 31:08.280
Manager.

31:10.200 --> 31:10.860
You two,

31:11.640 --> 31:12.720
what a coincidence.

31:12.720 --> 31:13.980
Shopping for watches?

31:15.270 --> 31:16.730
Which one caught your eye?

31:16.790 --> 31:17.720
We know the boss,

31:17.750 --> 31:19.280
so we can get you a discount.

31:20.140 --> 31:21.960
Mentioning Mr. Lu gets a discount?

31:21.960 --> 31:22.810
That's great.

31:22.920 --> 31:24.380
We're doing an appraisal.

31:26.160 --> 31:26.620
This...

31:27.310 --> 31:28.110
What about it?

31:33.070 --> 31:34.200
This is a nice watch.

31:35.110 --> 31:36.620
Where did you buy it?

31:36.920 --> 31:37.400
Mr. Lu,

31:37.400 --> 31:38.480
isn't this watch...

31:38.480 --> 31:39.070
What?

31:55.960 --> 31:56.710
Sir,

31:56.830 --> 31:57.720
you just said

31:57.720 --> 31:59.200
who brought this watch in?

32:00.160 --> 32:00.890
Miss,

32:01.240 --> 32:01.920
I'm sorry.

32:02.680 --> 32:04.140
This is customer privacy,

32:04.160 --> 32:05.290
I can't disclose it.

32:06.640 --> 32:07.240
Song Xing,

32:07.310 --> 32:07.970
take it out.

32:19.160 --> 32:19.750
It's...

32:21.790 --> 32:22.590
It's...

32:24.920 --> 32:25.520
It's real.

32:27.030 --> 32:28.270
I appraised it.

32:29.270 --> 32:29.870
It's real.

32:30.350 --> 32:31.370
But

32:31.640 --> 32:32.150
well...

32:32.470 --> 32:34.200
the person who brought it in...

32:34.920 --> 32:36.920
I really can't remember.

32:48.880 --> 32:51.340
Those two are definitely hiding something.

32:51.500 --> 32:53.160
Liu Bei was wearing the watch,

32:53.590 --> 32:54.550
but why did it seem like Lu Yibo

32:54.550 --> 32:55.640
recognized it?

32:55.960 --> 32:57.220
It doesn't make sense.

32:58.480 --> 33:00.140
Liu Bei is new to Sanjiangkou?

33:00.480 --> 33:00.880
Right.

33:01.310 --> 33:04.370
Captain Wang said
that's what Zheng Yongbing told him.

33:09.680 --> 33:11.240
Why are you starting the car?

33:11.240 --> 33:12.590
Aren't we going back to the station?

33:12.590 --> 33:13.160
No.

33:14.400 --> 33:16.480
Just because the manager
can't remember now

33:16.480 --> 33:16.960
doesn't mean

33:16.960 --> 33:18.360
he won't remember later.

33:23.750 --> 33:25.010
How could this happen?

33:26.400 --> 33:27.440
How could this be?

33:28.000 --> 33:28.880
Didn't you say the watch

33:28.880 --> 33:29.920
was already on a train

33:29.920 --> 33:31.050
out of Sanjiangkou?

33:32.000 --> 33:32.590
Yibo,

33:33.440 --> 33:34.790
you don't trust me either?

33:34.790 --> 33:36.060
Of course I trust you.

33:36.720 --> 33:37.520
But that watch

33:38.240 --> 33:40.970
couldn't have grown legs
and walked back, right?

33:43.680 --> 33:44.310
I got it.

33:44.640 --> 33:46.300
The police were following me.

33:47.590 --> 33:48.680
Did you have that watch

33:48.680 --> 33:50.210
serviced at the watch shop?

33:50.400 --> 33:50.830
Yes.

33:51.240 --> 33:52.030
Then I should give that manager

33:52.030 --> 33:52.960
some hush money.

33:54.510 --> 33:54.920
No.

33:55.350 --> 33:57.150
That'll only make things worse.

33:57.160 --> 33:58.350
The police will find out

33:58.350 --> 34:00.000
about this sooner or later.

34:07.110 --> 34:07.840
I'm done for.

34:08.630 --> 34:09.360
I'm done for.

34:10.440 --> 34:12.100
The police will catch us soon.

34:16.630 --> 34:18.960
Everything that's been happening lately

34:19.190 --> 34:20.489
has been way too intense.

34:20.489 --> 34:21.810
Danger and excitement

34:22.280 --> 34:23.440
are your turn-ons.

34:24.030 --> 34:24.590
Yibo,

34:25.590 --> 34:27.050
you're getting worked up.

34:39.110 --> 34:40.909
Is your blood pressure spiking?

34:41.330 --> 34:43.130
Mr. Rong won't let us off either.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.190
Yibo,

34:47.000 --> 34:47.760
let's just do

34:47.760 --> 34:49.290
what we need to do right now.

34:49.800 --> 34:50.929
As for the future...

34:51.550 --> 34:53.010
We'll talk about it later.

34:53.760 --> 34:55.090
Do we even have a future?

35:32.960 --> 35:33.850
I knew

35:33.960 --> 35:35.510
you two would come back to me.

35:35.510 --> 35:36.360
Do you remember

35:36.360 --> 35:37.440
who brought it in for service?

35:37.440 --> 35:38.110
I remember.

35:38.480 --> 35:39.080
Who was it?

35:40.510 --> 35:41.570
I don't want to say.

35:41.590 --> 35:43.250
Then why did you get in the car?

35:43.670 --> 35:44.670
I... well, I...

35:45.000 --> 35:45.460
Well...

35:45.480 --> 35:47.510
Cooperating with police investigations

35:47.510 --> 35:49.110
is the duty of every citizen.

35:49.150 --> 35:51.080
I didn't say I wouldn't cooperate.

35:51.440 --> 35:52.770
But I work here.

35:53.110 --> 35:53.920
I don't want to offend

35:53.920 --> 35:55.000
the wrong people.

35:57.320 --> 35:58.050
Understood.

35:58.960 --> 36:00.110
Then how can we

36:00.550 --> 36:02.360
make sure you don't offend anyone,

36:02.360 --> 36:03.840
and we still get our answer?

36:03.840 --> 36:05.590
Then you have to ask me.

36:06.030 --> 36:06.590
Ask what?

36:07.440 --> 36:08.280
Ask...

36:08.960 --> 36:11.290
"Doesn't the shop have service records?"

36:12.110 --> 36:14.310
Doesn't the shop have service records?

36:14.480 --> 36:14.960
Yes.

36:15.440 --> 36:16.190
Officers,

36:17.360 --> 36:17.800
we do.

36:33.760 --> 36:35.360
I searched through thousands of photos.

36:35.360 --> 36:36.320
Only these three

36:36.480 --> 36:37.360
have Ye in the background,

36:37.360 --> 36:38.190
but they are all of the back of his head,

36:38.190 --> 36:39.520
so they are very blurry.

36:43.230 --> 36:44.440
It's fine if Ye is blurry

36:44.440 --> 36:44.960
and unclear.

36:44.960 --> 36:46.220
Is Lu Yibo unclear too?

36:46.320 --> 36:47.480
There is one where Lu Yibo is quite clear.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.010
This one.

36:54.760 --> 36:55.290
Is there a

36:55.360 --> 36:55.960
digital version?

36:55.960 --> 36:56.960
Show me the digital version of this one.

36:56.960 --> 36:57.280
Yes.

37:09.800 --> 37:10.280
Chief.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.200
We have a clue.

37:12.230 --> 37:13.670
Did you find out whose watch it is?

37:13.670 --> 37:14.530
It's Lu Yibo's.

37:16.440 --> 37:17.300
How do you know?

37:17.550 --> 37:18.550
Did you follow us?

37:20.030 --> 37:21.190
Even the serial number is the same.

37:21.190 --> 37:22.120
It's confirmed.

37:24.780 --> 37:26.240
[Watch Servicing Record]

37:26.840 --> 37:28.700
Song Xing did a good job this time.

37:35.590 --> 37:37.160
Now it's time to go back to

37:37.230 --> 37:37.960
Fenglinwan.

37:39.630 --> 37:40.280
We'll toss

37:40.280 --> 37:41.400
a pebble

37:41.670 --> 37:42.510
into his little heart

37:42.510 --> 37:44.710
and see what kind of ripples it creates.

37:49.110 --> 37:50.910
What kind of ripples it creates.

37:59.110 --> 37:59.920
Wang, let's go.

37:59.920 --> 38:00.630
Let's go take a look.

38:00.630 --> 38:01.300
Let's go.

38:09.760 --> 38:12.430
[Municipal Bureau Chief Zhang Yi'ang]

38:16.630 --> 38:17.400
Chief Zhang.

38:17.800 --> 38:18.330
Mr. Lu,

38:19.110 --> 38:20.370
are you at Fenglinwan?

38:20.550 --> 38:21.230
In five minutes,

38:21.230 --> 38:22.710
Captain Wang and I will be there.

38:22.710 --> 38:24.510
What's the matter, Chief Zhang?

38:24.700 --> 38:26.430
I just want to talk to you again.

38:28.030 --> 38:29.190
Can we do it another day?

38:29.190 --> 38:30.230
I lost something.

38:30.230 --> 38:31.840
I have to go back and look for it.

38:31.840 --> 38:33.100
Mr. Lu lost something.

38:33.320 --> 38:34.280
Since you lost something,

38:34.280 --> 38:35.110
you should come to us.

38:35.110 --> 38:36.110
That's our job.

38:36.840 --> 38:37.630
Or how about this?

38:37.630 --> 38:39.480
You go to the Public Security Bureau,

38:39.480 --> 38:40.280
explain everything clearly,

38:40.280 --> 38:41.480
and we'll help you find it.

38:41.480 --> 38:42.340
Take your pick.

38:42.400 --> 38:43.200
Either works.

38:44.190 --> 38:44.840
I'm here.

38:45.400 --> 38:46.400
I'll wait for you.

38:46.480 --> 38:46.880
Okay.

38:55.590 --> 38:57.590
What happened? You lost something?

38:57.670 --> 38:58.670
What did you lose?

39:07.110 --> 39:08.240
Is this watch yours?

39:11.440 --> 39:12.110
I lost it,

39:13.110 --> 39:14.840
but it wasn't originally mine.

39:38.110 --> 39:39.150
When did Lang Bowen

39:39.150 --> 39:40.410
lose this watch to you?

39:43.190 --> 39:44.120
About a year ago.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.380
I don't remember clearly.

39:46.510 --> 39:47.280
The information about this watch

39:47.280 --> 39:48.360
is very important to us.

39:48.360 --> 39:50.290
Think carefully before you speak.

39:52.360 --> 39:54.070
I'll ask you this question again.

39:54.070 --> 39:55.280
The night of Ye Jian's incident,

39:55.280 --> 39:56.740
did he come to Fenglinwan?

40:01.840 --> 40:02.280
Mr. Lu.

40:02.880 --> 40:03.280
Mr. Lu.

40:03.880 --> 40:05.110
Let me remind you.

40:05.360 --> 40:06.050
Without any evidence,

40:06.050 --> 40:06.630
we wouldn't be

40:06.630 --> 40:08.290
coming to you again and again.

40:09.880 --> 40:10.940
I gave you a chance.

40:12.440 --> 40:14.240
This is really your last chance.

40:30.230 --> 40:30.810
Yes.

40:31.630 --> 40:32.340
He came.

40:33.150 --> 40:34.350
Why did Ye come to you?

40:36.190 --> 40:37.920
He also asked about that watch.

40:39.510 --> 40:41.310
Why didn't you tell us last time?

40:44.360 --> 40:45.630
Later, Ye died.

40:46.920 --> 40:48.980
I was afraid of getting into trouble.

41:01.210 --> 41:05.610
[The World's Jokes]

41:11.510 --> 41:12.040
Mr. Rong.

41:12.440 --> 41:13.230
Wait.

41:16.150 --> 41:25.440
[The World's Jokes]

41:17.030 --> 41:18.430
Let me ask you a question.

41:19.030 --> 41:20.510
A mushroom met an orange.

41:20.840 --> 41:23.070
The mushroom told the orange to drop dead,

41:23.070 --> 41:24.440
and the orange did.

41:24.760 --> 41:25.190
Why?

41:27.550 --> 41:28.440
I don't know.

41:29.000 --> 41:30.070
Do you know why recently

41:30.070 --> 41:30.630
I don't find jokes

41:30.630 --> 41:31.800
funny anymore?

41:34.440 --> 41:35.550
Is Lu Yibo causing trouble

41:35.550 --> 41:36.270
again?

41:36.400 --> 41:38.400
If he dares, I'll make him drop dead.

41:38.630 --> 41:40.490
And you can take over Fenglinwan.

41:40.760 --> 41:41.290
Mr. Rong,

41:41.760 --> 41:42.590
I know something

41:42.590 --> 41:43.850
that will cheer you up.

41:45.400 --> 41:46.030
Zhu Yifei

41:46.190 --> 41:47.610
will be in Sanjiangkou soon.

41:47.610 --> 41:49.340
We can make the deal right away.

41:50.880 --> 41:51.680
Get to it then.

41:53.030 --> 41:53.920
Don't worry, Mr. Rong.

41:53.920 --> 41:54.840
Zhu Yifei is

41:54.840 --> 41:56.400
a big shot in the underworld.

41:56.400 --> 41:57.800
He wouldn't do something as low as

41:57.800 --> 41:58.680
selling fakes.

41:59.070 --> 42:00.280
He's not a small fry.

42:05.380 --> 42:06.340
[Zheng Yongbing]

42:09.880 --> 42:11.340
I'll take this call first.

42:18.880 --> 42:19.280
Hello?

42:19.440 --> 42:20.000
Ren,

42:20.590 --> 42:21.440
can you sell the God of Wealth statue

42:21.440 --> 42:23.240
back to me at the original price?

42:23.630 --> 42:24.560
Zheng Yongbing,

42:24.840 --> 42:26.370
don't push your luck, okay?

42:26.880 --> 42:27.840
Don't you know

42:27.840 --> 42:28.630
how much I paid you

42:28.630 --> 42:29.890
for that piece of junk?

42:29.960 --> 42:30.670
Ren,

42:31.190 --> 42:32.920
do you think I want to buy it back?

42:32.920 --> 42:34.650
The investigators are onto me.

42:34.880 --> 42:36.280
I have to return the stolen goods.

42:36.280 --> 42:37.410
None of my business.

42:38.110 --> 42:39.070
Why would the investigators

42:39.070 --> 42:40.730
care about your petty crimes?

42:43.280 --> 42:44.080
If I had known,

42:44.760 --> 42:46.710
I would have melted it all down to sell,

42:46.710 --> 42:47.550
instead of selling it to that woman

42:47.550 --> 42:48.410
at Fenglinwan.

42:50.110 --> 42:50.910
Wait a minute.

42:52.880 --> 42:54.510
You're saying the police tracked you down

42:54.510 --> 42:55.710
through Fenglinwan?

42:55.920 --> 42:56.720
That's right.

42:59.890 --> 43:00.970
Who's the woman?

43:01.360 --> 43:01.960
Zhou Qi.

43:02.070 --> 43:03.470
I sold the jewelry to her,

43:03.550 --> 43:04.810
and she snitched on me.

43:05.000 --> 43:05.480
Ren,

43:05.630 --> 43:07.360
I'll add another 20,000, okay?

43:09.000 --> 43:09.610
Ren?
